    "text": "<blockquote><p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(B)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>graphite</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>If the equation is multiplied the value&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>, then the enthalpy change value also multiplied by factor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the enthalpy is positive in one direction, it is negative in other direction.</p><p>Multiply equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and subtract equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math> from it</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>graphite</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>graphite</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>CO</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
